  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cocoa LIRP supermarket work 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities by ODE:
- approx 0,7 FTE for a Policy Advisor on Human Rights Due Diligence
o Weekly coordination calls until April 2025to prepare briefing paper
o Engagement with supermarkets prior and after the Easter spike
o In-supermarket-research for shelf-shareof Living Income chocolate
o Contributing German perspective to the briefing paper
o Production of social media posts (IG, LinkedIn)
o Where needed, contributing German perspective to the development of campaign materials (NL, Belgium, possibly German partners), as they affect German supermarkets
o Press release just before Easter and media work
o Hiring and managing translator briefing paper(English to German)
o Coordination with German cocoa partners (mainly Inkota)</narrative>
  </description>
